    [CI] Update 10.09 memory dependencies for v0.30.0 (#18213)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    Updates the default memory dependency package set for the v0.30.0
    release image builds to 1009:
    
    - memcache 1.3.0 build 20261009.15
    - memfabric 1.3.0 build 20261009.10
    
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    No. This updates CI and image build defaults only.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    - `git diff --check upstream/releases/v0.30.0...HEAD`
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/ced6857afa0ea7b2e3f0846a62e1394e90f15607
    
    Signed-off-by: underfituu <hzhucong@163.com>

